+# Human resolution — S5-CLM-00003490
+
+ANCHOR:RES-ROOT-OPEN
+
+## Polarity
+
+The exact orientation is Claim. The proposition is:
+
+∀ n a b c d, IsCrystalWithComponents n a b →
+  IsCrystalWithComponents n c d →
+  ({a, b} : Finset ℕ) = {c, d}
+
+## Evidence reviewed
+
+The frozen source record, the source predicate, the definitional target
+transport, and the bounded enumeration through 2 ≤ a ≤ b ≤ 100 were
+reviewed. The enumeration finds 11 unordered pairs and no repeated n in
+that box, including (n,a,b) = (35,5,7).
+
+## Resolution
+
+No complete proof of universal uniqueness and no checked counterexample were
+found. The finite observation cannot settle the universal quantifiers, and
+the source sorryAx is not accepted as mathematical evidence. Therefore the
+human resolution is open; this handoff does not claim a terminal outcome.
