+## Identity and transport
+
+The source predicate is
+Odd n ∧ 1<a ∧ 1<b ∧ n=a*b ∧ 2*(a+1)*(b+1) divides
+(a+b)^2+(a*b+1)^2. The target SourceStatement and Target are the same
+Lean proposition, and source_to_target/target_to_source are Iff.rfl. This
+establishes exact statement identity, not truth of the conjecture.
