+## Exploration
+
+A deterministic search over unordered component pairs through 100 found 11
+pairs and no repeated product. The observation includes (35,5,7) and is
+sealed in research/attempt-001.json; it is bounded evidence only.
+
+## Resolution
+
+No complete proof or checked refutation was found. The resolution DAG,
+human review, machine closure, and release receipt therefore all preserve
+the open Claim polarity. The target is ready for independent Master review,
+not for terminal theorem credit.
